{"title":"What should I ask Gaurav Kapadia?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/925596680/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Gaurav-Kapadia.html","date":1759260182000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him.  He is a tried and true New Yorker like few others, a very successful investor and head of XN, a long term focused investment firm that invests across public and private markets.  He is a “generational investor,” one of the most successful over the last twenty years.  He is also an avid collector of contemporary art, and he serves on the Boards of Trustees of The Mellon Foundation, The Whitney Museum of American Art, The Trust for Governors Island, and The Institute for Constitutional Advocacy and Protection and is a member of The Council on Foreign Relations.  And more.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.google.com/search?q=gaurav+kapadia&amp;sca_esv=f3826a3017f5c801&amp;source=hp&amp;ei=xS3caOaqGrCf5NoP4JL1kAg&amp;iflsig=AOw8s4IAAAAAaNw71XYxoUzpNNP5yJOTO1h1NHugPCn6&amp;ved=0ahUKEwimoafLmoGQAxWwD1kFHWBJHYIQ4dUDCBo&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=gaurav+kapadia&amp;gs_lp=Egdnd3Mtd2l6Ig5nYXVyYXYga2FwYWRpYTIFEAAYgAQyBRAAGIAEMgUQABiABDIFEAAYgAQyBRAAGIAEMgUQABiABDIFEAAYgAQyBRAAGIAEMgUQABiABDIFEAAYgARI_&amp;sclient=gws-wiz\" target=\"_blank\">Google on Gaurav Kapadia</a>.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>Do not forget — in equilibrium the lesser-known guests probably are on average better.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/what-should-i-ask-gaurav-kapadia.html\">What should I ask Gaurav Kapadia?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/925596680/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedb